{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52196","headline":"颂六十二首 二十一 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百旬芥易尽，三灾理自倾。\n石火无恒焰，电光非久停。\n饥窘自相噉，刀兵竞相征。\n疫病无医効，空劳怨苦声。\n亲戚无相救，残害有余情。\n遗文虚满笥，徒欣富贵盈。\n太息波川迅，悲斯苦业萦。\n生灭恒敦逼，煎迫未安宁。\n（见《法苑珠林》卷四《大三灾部之余》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}